<title>USA: Hybridon cleared to begin trials for drug.</title>
<headline>Hybridon cleared to begin trials for drug.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hybridon Inc said on Monday that the U.S. Food and Drug Administration approved the company's application to begin clinical trials for GEM 132, a drug to treat cytomegalovirus infections.</p>
<p>This represents the second investigational new drug application for GEM 132 approved by the agency, Hybridon Inc said.</p>
</text>
